{"speciesId":161,"names":{"fr":"Fouinette","es":"Sentret","en":"Sentret","ja":"オタチ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"A very cautious POKéMON, it raises itself up using its tail to get a better view of its surroundings."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It stands on its tail so it can see a long way. If it spots an enemy, it cries loudly to warn its kind."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"When acting as a lookout, it warns others of danger by screeching and hitting the ground with its tail."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"When SENTRET sleeps, it does so while another stands guard. The sentry wakes the others at the first sign of danger. When this POKéMON becomes separated from its pack, it becomes incapable of sleep due to fear."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"When SENTRET sleeps, it does so while another stands guard. The sentry wakes the others at the first sign of danger. When this POKéMON becomes separated from its pack, it becomes incapable of sleep due to fear."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"They take turns standing guard when it is time to sleep. The sentry awakens the others if it senses danger. If one becomes separated, it turns sleepless with fear."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It stands on its tail so it can see a long way. If it spots an enemy, it cries loudly to warn its kind."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"A very cautious POKéMON, it raises itself up using its tail to get a better view of its surroundings."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It has a very nervous nature. It stands up high on its tail so it can scan wide areas."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It has a very nervous nature. It stands up high on its tail so it can scan wide areas."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It has a very nervous nature. It stands up high on its tail so it can scan wide areas."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"A very cautious Pokémon, it raises itself up using its tail to get a better view of its surroundings."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It stands on its tail so it can see a long way. If it spots an enemy, it cries loudly to warn its kind."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ce Pokémon très nerveux prend appui sur sa queue pour observer ses alentours."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It has a very nervous nature. It stands up high on its tail so it can scan wide areas."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ce Pokémon très nerveux prend appui sur sa queue pour observer ses alentours."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It has a very nervous nature. It stands up high on its tail so it can scan wide areas."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It has a very nervous nature. It stands up high on its tail so it can scan wide areas."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It has a very nervous nature. It stands up high on its tail so it can scan wide areas."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"S’il fait le guet, il prévient les autres d’un danger en criant et en frappant le sol de sa queue."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuando hace de centinela, avisa del peligro a los demás, chillando y dando golpes al suelo con la cola."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"When acting as a lookout, it warns others of danger by screeching and hitting the ground with its tail."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"見張り役は 鋭く 鳴いたり 尻尾で 地面を たたいたりして 仲間に 危険を 知らせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il se tient dressé sur sa queue pour voir les ennemis arriver de loin. À ce moment, il avertit ses amis."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Se apoya sobre su cola para ver a mucha distancia. Si divisa a un enemigo, dará la alarma a gritos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It stands on its tail so it can see a long way. If it spots an enemy, it cries loudly to warn its kind."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"遠くまで 見れるように 尻尾を 使って 立つ。敵を 見つけると 大声で 仲間に 知らせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lorsqu’un Fouinette dort, un autre monte la garde. La sentinelle réveille les autres au moindre signe de danger. Si un de ces Pokémon est séparé de sa meute, il est incapable de dormir, car il a peur."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Sentret no duerme a menos que otro haga guardia. El que hace de centinela lo despertará al mínimo signo de peligro. Cuando este Pokémon se separa de su manada, es incapaz de echarse a dormir, presa del miedo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"When Sentret sleeps, it does so while another stands guard. The sentry wakes the others at the first sign of danger. When this Pokémon becomes separated from its pack, it becomes incapable of sleep due to fear."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"眠る ときには 交代で 見張りをする。 危険を 察知すると 仲間を おこすのだ。 群れから はぐれると 怖くて 眠れなくなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lorsqu’un Fouinette dort, un autre monte la garde. La sentinelle réveille les autres au moindre signe de danger. Si un de ces Pokémon est séparé de sa meute, il est incapable de dormir, car il a peur."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sentret no duerme a menos que otro haga guardia. El que hace de centinela lo despertará al mínimo signo de peligro. Cuando este Pokémon se separa de su manada, es incapaz de echarse a dormir, presa del miedo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"When Sentret sleeps, it does so while another stands guard. The sentry wakes the others at the first sign of danger. When this Pokémon becomes separated from its pack, it becomes incapable of sleep due to fear."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"眠る ときには 交代で 見張りをする。 危険を 察知すると 仲間を おこすのだ。 群れから はぐれると 怖くて 眠れなくなる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":161,"moves":[{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",